18.
Authorities of the University.
- The following shall be the authorities of the University, namely:-
(1)
The Senate;
(2)
The Syndicate;
(3)
The Academic Council;
(4)
The Faculties;
(5)
The Examination Board;
(6)
The Finance Committee;
(7)
The Planning and Evaluation Committee; and
(8)
Such other authorities as may be declared to be the authorities of the University by the Statutes.
